awss-monitor-analyze.code:
Metric filter on CloudTrail log group:
{ $.userIdentity.type = "Root" && $.userIdentity.invokedBy NOT EXISTS && $.eventType != "AwsServiceEvent" }

Metric: RootUsageCount   Alarm: >= 1 in 5 min -> SNS security-alerts

awss-iam-advanced.code:
Developers may create roles only if they attach this boundary:
"Condition": { "StringEquals": {
  "iam:PermissionsBoundary": "arn:aws:iam::111122223333:policy/dev-boundary" } }

dev-boundary allows: s3, dynamodb, lambda, logs
Effective permissions = identity policy AND boundary

